  "notes": "{繋|つな}ぐ is a transitive godan verb meaning to connect, link, or tie.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- {繋|つな}ぐ (⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧): to connect (transitive)\n- ⟦{繋|つな}がる→繋がる：01963_tsunagaru⟧ (⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧): to be connected (intransitive)\n\nWRITING:\nOften written in hiragana as つなぐ due to the complexity of {繋|つな}.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{手|て}→手：00569_te⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{繋|つな}ぐ: to hold hands\n- ⟦{命|いのち}→命：02371_inochi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{繋|つな}ぐ: to sustain life\n- ⟦{電話|でんわ}→電話：01471_denwa⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{繋|つな}ぐ: to connect a call\n- ⟦{犬|いぬ}→犬：00632_inu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{繋|つな}ぐ: to tie up a dog\n- ⟦ネット→ネット：05279_netto⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{繋|つな}ぐ: to connect to the internet\n- ⟦{世代|せだい}→世代：05102_sedai⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{繋|つな}ぐ: to bridge generations\n\nUSAGE:\n- ⟦{絆|きずな}→絆：02509_kizuna⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{繋|つな}ぐ: to maintain bonds\n- ⟦{未来|みらい}→未来：03748_mirai⟧⟦へ→へ：02473_he⟧{繋|つな}ぐ: to pass on to the future",
